      "writtenOn": "2024-03-25T11:59:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "What is the deletion/reset path of Service VM? Can/should the client (rkpd?) reset the vm\u0027s state (delete VM/ reboot a VM). If so how?\n\nThe context is, we should delete the the instance-id just allocated to VM using using `removeVmInstance()` once the VM is obsolete.\n\nIf factory reset is the only way service vm becomes obsolete, then we\u0027re covered by the fact the VS\u0027 db also gets deleted on FR, but if there are other ways of resetting the service vm, we should cover those.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 126,
        "startChar": 0,
